The lines look like vector graphics:
- uniform-width, round-capped 'pills' with flat 3-stop gradients;
- pure black between them (0 green cast);
- no faint hairline streaks.

The source streaks are soft and taper at both ends. Their black carries many faint 1–2 px streaks (value about 30–60) and a green cast of +3.5 to +4 levels (G − (R+B)/2 measured at k40 and k75 in darks, mids and highlights; the render measures 0.0).
